This project is a studing of pandas on python by doing data transformations to my local bus service (SPTrans)

The data is from 11/24/2026

Data analysis observations:
- The data only includes one trip per line, so the times can vary from real life timing
- The times looks computer generated and are not really precise
- NaN trip times for "volta" occours because circular lines only has data for "ida" trips, so the data for "volta" is NaN